4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning rush is becoming a physical hazard. We need to address the congestion immediately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Before we discuss solutions, we must understand the financial implications for the building.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I have noticed the same flats seem to claim the best spots every time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We need a system that prevents social friction from escalating into conflict.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,Who is actually going to maintain whatever system we choose? I worry about the workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, cost is important, but safety is more urgent. We are blocking each other.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if we cannot afford the fix, the problem remains. I need to check the accounts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the history of how these spots were assigned.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I want to see if other buildings have faced similar issues and how they resolved them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I will check the physical effort required to manage any new setup.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,The rain also damages bikes in the exposed rows. That is a maintenance issue too.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will review the ledger to see if we have funds for capital work.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will also check the minutes to see if this has been discussed before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the complaint log to gauge the severity of recent incidents.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the supplier's frame to see if it is practical for daily use.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let us gather the facts before we vote. I will check the rain exposure.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. I will also look at the ward cycle park as a benchmark.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will check the sticker register to see who actually rides daily.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the neighbouring block's account for lessons learned.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will check the treasurer's file to understand the administrative burden.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
