31,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"I watched the mornings. Eleven bikes leave between seven and nine, and four times someone had to shift another.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows little capital reserve. The ward park charges 2,600 yen, and fourteen households are waiting there.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The minutes show the same flats held covered spots for years with no review. The sticker register shows varied usage.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The complaint log has nine entries about leaning bikes, all unresolved. The neighbouring block had arrears and absenteeism.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,The display frame takes twenty seconds to load and needs greasing. The treasurer spends three hours a month on cash.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if the ward park is full, we cannot just tell people to go there. We need internal order.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, exactly. And if we charge, we need to know if it covers the cost. The ledger is thin.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, three hours a month is significant. If we add billing, that time increases.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, the neighbouring block's failure was due to arrears. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I agree. The physical effort of the racks is also a concern. It is not trivial.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The rain exposure is bad. Bikes under the eaves are dry, but others get wet. This affects value.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If we implement a paid system, the income could go to the shared account for maintenance.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"The sticker register shows some households ride daily, others rarely. A flat rule might be unfair.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A lottery might seem fair, but it ignores the daily riders who need reliability.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"Shared racks might work, but who cleans them? The treasurer's time is already stretched.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We need a solution that addresses both the morning rush and the rain damage.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,A paid allocation could fund the maintenance and ensure those who use it most pay for it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I am concerned about the social impact. We need to be careful not to alienate residents.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I think a paid system is the most sustainable. It aligns cost with usage.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I am hesitant about the administrative burden, but if it solves the problem, it might be worth it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
